      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A new triterpenoid, namely 3β-hydroxy-13β,28-epoxyolean-11-enyl trans-caffeate (1), was isolated from the EtOAc extract from Ixeris chinensis Nakai. The structures of 1 were elucidated by spectroscopic methods, including UV, IR, HR-ESI-MS and extensive 1D and 2D NMR techniques."},
